WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:05.960
This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, organizations, laws, etc.

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:05.960
are products of the author's imagination or used fictitiously.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.790
Good morning, Koushi! Take these, too.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:18.210
Miss Mineru! I really think you ought to
wash your own underwear!

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.330
Oh, relax. It's not a big deal.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:21.790
Ah, I almost forgot.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:23.920
These ones, too.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.790
Just kidding!

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:33.040
I already changed into a fresh pair.

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:36.500
Miss Mineru!

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.790
'Kay, catch ya later!

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.710
This is part of my job as dorm mother. It's my job...!

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:53.630
Huh? Should I dry them in the shade instead...?

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.670
Well I wouldn't want them to get stolen...

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.420
Wait, I can see them from my room!

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:03.750
W-will they even dry like that...?

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.170
I have no idea anymore...

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:14.710
At least the weather's nice.

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:17.210
It's Golden Week this week.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.420
I wonder if the residents have
any special vacation plans...

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:24.040
It's already been two weeks since I moved in...

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:29.710
My house burned down right after I started school,
and I haven't gone back since.

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:33.710
That's why I have to find a job.

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:36.750
And I want to go to school, too.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.880
School, eh?

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.630
I wonder how my friends are doing...

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.380
You're just pretending not to notice, aren't you?

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:03.290
I can see the truth in your eyes

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:06.290
This isn't some sort of dramatic romance

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:09.920
My flushed body feels like it could melt

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.880
Honestly, I'm just being shy

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.830
Let me stir up feelings deep inside

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.580
I'll dress you in this outfit

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.540
See? My heart races for nobody but you

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:27.000
It is what it is, take it as it comes, just go with the flow

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.000
If you peer through the other side of the glass

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.420
You'll see a world of charming sweeties

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:38.880
Face to face, hold me in your arms, squeeze me tight

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.830
I want you so close to my side that

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:44.210
I can feel your pulse

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.540
Ooey-gooey love

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:50.830
My feelings for you get jumbled up by naughty love

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:52.380
Ooey-gooey love

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:57.130
Whatever you want, do as you like, I don't mind

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:59.830
Tracing my fingers along your skin

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:03.250
I'll show you a syrupy-sweet dream

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:05.880
When I stare at your lips

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.080
I wanna kiss you more and more

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:21.040
Episode 3

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:21.040
Koushi, At a Loss

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:25.080
Golden Week, a vacation made up of
ten consecutive holidays, is finally upon us!

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.040
Golden Week's

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.040
Best-Kept Secrets

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.080
Milk

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:27.670
There, that should do it.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:29.920
It's about time to call everyone downstairs...

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.710
Saotome

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:32.710
Miss Atena!

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.880
Breakfast is ready!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.130
Coming!

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:41.380
Whoa, wait a minute. Try that again.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:42.080
Huh?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:43.580
Say it like a little brother.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.540
And call me "Big Sister" this time!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.540
A-are you serious?

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:48.750
Please?

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:54.460
B-Big Sister, breakfast is ready.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.290
Good morning, Koushi!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.290
G-good morning...

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:06.380
I'm sorry that you always have to cook for us.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.790
It's okay. I like cooking.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.750
Either way, I appre-

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.250
It's still tricky, isn't it?

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.960
Yeah, but if I try hard enough...!

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.080
There's no need to strain yourself.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.960
No! I can do it...

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.290
Just a little more...!

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.170
What were you staring at just now?

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.790
I wasn't staring! I swear!

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:35.580
So our darling Koushi likes clothes like these...

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:36.790
That's not true!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.960
Then how about I model a negligee for you?

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.170
A sheer one.

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.630
Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.250
What'd I do?!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.830
Attempting to seduce Koushi
counts as immoral conduct!

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.500
Oh, look who's talking.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:54.380
You're the one who absolutely insists
on being called "Big Sister."

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:56.040
Were you spying on me?!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.960
Oh, no. The walls are thin.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.250
Hold it right there!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.500
I simply cannot ignore such an insult!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.920
If Koushi's the little brother,
then I'm obviously the big sister!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.750
Right, Koushi? I'm totally right, aren't I?!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:12.170
Then perhaps we should have a competition
to see who makes the best big sister.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.880
Why is that your solution?!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.170
'Cause I'm bored.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:18.170
Thanks for breakfast!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.830
Ahem. Now then...

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.960
Go ahead, Koushi. Call me "Big Sister."

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.880
Um, it's just...

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.790
Oh, would you prefer "Sister Dearest" instead?

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.290
Or "Darling Sister"?

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.670
That's not the issue...

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:33.790
Why the heck am I wearing this thing?!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:37.630
Older sisters like to dress their
younger brothers in cute outfits, don't they?

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:40.630
No, I... I think that's just you, Miss Frey...

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:41.880
Really...?

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:45.670
Besides, this is meant for a little sister,
not a little brother.

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.000
As long as you look cute, does it truly matter?

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.670
It suits you beautifully, my precious doll.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:54.000
D-doll...?

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.380
Didn't you know?

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.580
Younger brothers are playthings
for their older sisters.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.790
A-are you sure about that?!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.040
Frey, you're disqualified!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.380
Lying to Koushi is against the rules!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.380
Aw...

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:10.460
This was your idea in the first place, Mineru.
What would you do?

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:11.460
Me? Well...

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:14.130
First, I'd have him test a new concoction of mine!

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:17.830
Everyone knows that little brothers are
the most convenient guinea pigs.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.630
Why?!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.210
Oh? Are you gettin' in on this, Serene?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.080
Here it comes, folks:
Serene's best impression of a big sister...

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.750
I'm hungry...

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:40.250
Too bad! That was, in fact, an impression of a pet!

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:44.130
Time to let a professional show you how it's done!

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:47.080
Kiriya does have little brothers IRL...

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.500
Well? How would you spend time with Koushi?

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.920
Why, isn't it obvious?

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:53.500
By letting our bodies do the talking, of course!

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.420
This is perfect.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:00.420
This is what it feels like to be siblings!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.580
M-Miss Kiriya... give! I give...!

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:03.580
I don't think so!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.080
You ain't seen nothin' yet, Koushi!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.960
Doesn't it feel nice, Koushi?

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.170
Koushi?!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.210
Stay with us! Kiriya, you went way overboard!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.130
I didn't mean to...!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:30.540
Wake up, Koushi!

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:36.500
Don't worry. Your big sister is right here.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.130
More like a mother than a sister, don'tcha think?

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:47.170
Is he breastfed?

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:48.540
I'M HIS SISTER!

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.000
I'm sorry, Koushi.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.210
Are you alright?

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.500
No, this whole thing was my fault in the first place!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.250
Take this juice as an apology! Drink up!
You poor thing... C'mon, let's get you changed.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.250
I'm hungry. Let me have that.
Hold it, Frey!

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.630
No way! This juice is for Koushi!
Aw, where's the harm?

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:15.920
Hurry up and get undressed, Koushi.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.040
It's kinda crazy around here...
Please cut it out! Koushi's a boy!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.080
But it's not so bad, to be honest.
Wait, don't drink that-!

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.460
But it's not so bad, to be honest.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.500
I get the feeling that this is
what it's like to have big sisters...

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:32.710
Well these big sisters of yours
have a surprise for you!

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.670
Mineru, do you mean...?!

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:37.250
Yup! It's the moment we've all been waiting for.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:38.040
Huh?

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:43.000
Koushi, after Golden Week is over,
you get to go back to school!

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.040
What?!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.630
You'll commute from here, of course.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:47.920
Nice job, Mineru!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:48.710
I know.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.210
Um, I'm not exactly sure how it works,

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.580
but isn't there some sort of
complicated process involved...?

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:56.130
Not really. I just had to sign some paperwork.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:58.000
And I helped her do it.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.210
Yay!

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:02.540
No way... It can't be that simple.

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:05.210
They probably had to jump through
a bunch of hoops...

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.710
U-um...

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:10.170
Thank you so much! Miss Mineru, Miss Frey!

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:13.170
I think you mean, "Thanks, Big Sisters."

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.580
I'll do my very best!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.130
I'll be a good dorm mother and a good student!

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:21.290
Lucky you, eh, Koushi?

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.330
Yeah!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:22.750
Wow, you guys really can be reliable sometimes.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.580
I called myself his big sister,
but what the heck am I doing?
Wow, you guys really can be reliable sometimes.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.830
I called myself his big sister,
but what the heck am I doing?
Nah, I wouldn't go that far.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:31.580
I knew that this would make him the happiest,
so why didn't I think of it earlier...?

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:36.580
I'm happy for you, Koushi.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:37.920
I'll do my best, too.

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.920
To be more like a big sister to you.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:48.040
Episode 3

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:48.040
Koushi Goes Back to School

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.170
Back to school at last!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:06.960
Alright!

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:13.540
Koushi Nagumo

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.920
I get my very own shoe locker...!

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:20.460
I finally get to experience the joys of
being a middle schooler-

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:23.630
AND WHERE THE HELL HAVE YOU BEEN?!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:30.790
Y-y-you...

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:37.040
Sutea...!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:42.580
I get that your house burned down and everything...

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.000
but at least send me a damn text!

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:54.710
Do you have... any idea...
just how... worried I was...?

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:56.540
Sutea...

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.830
'Cause I wasn't. Like, at all.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:10:59.710
Huh?

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.330
Then what's with all the theatrics?!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.000
Her name is Sutea Khoroya.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:15.880
She's my classmate, and she can be
kinda touchy sometimes.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.630
The two of us have been friends since preschool.

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:29.960
Dammit, I did it again!

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:33.420
Why can't I tell him that I was worried
about him like a normal person?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.960
Why'd I have to be a jerk?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.580
Wait a second, Sutea!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.420
Shut up. Don't talk to me.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:40.750
You're right, I shouldn't have left you in the dark.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:41.920
I'm sorry.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.380
It wasn't like I forgot about you!

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:45.880
Things have been really hectic up until recently...

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.250
Year 1 Class 3

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:54.960
"Botchan," the quintessential work of author
Natsume Soseki, is a novel filled with humor.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:57.080
She's majorly pissed!
"Botchan," the quintessential work of author
Natsume Soseki, is a novel filled with humor.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:00.580
Then again, it's 'cause she was worried about me...
"Botchan," the quintessential work of author
Natsume Soseki, is a novel filled with humor.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:02.960
I should've borrowed the dorm's phone or something.

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.880
I should've reached out to her...

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.960
Sorry, Sutea. I promise to tell you.

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:11.330
About everything that happened the past few weeks.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:15.540
Is telling her about the Goddess Dormitory
really a good idea...?!

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:25.080
What's the matter, Nagumo?!

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.540
Is there something wrong with your textbook?!

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:28.710
Oh, yes! No! It's fine!

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:31.290
No way... I'll have to fudge the details...

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:33.130
In the meantime, I have to hurry...!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.330
Hurry...!

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.710
I have to talk to Sutea...!

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.540
It's finally over!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.380
Nagumo!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:45.080
Yessir?!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:47.290
It must have been so hard on you...

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.920
I heard about what happened
from one of your relatives.

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:53.170
My relative?! That's her excuse?!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.250
"Excuse"?

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.500
N-never mind!

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.330
You should've told me beforehand, Miss Mineru!

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:01.130
Let me know if there's anything
I can do to help, okay?!

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:02.040
Okay.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.420
Thank you, sir! Uh... Goodbye!

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:08.080
Anything at all, Koushi!

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.080
Sutea!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.380
Listen...

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.880
Ah, hold on!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:31.630
Let go.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:32.540
Huh?

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:33.460
Let go!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.630
Don't ever touch me like that!

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.130
That's right...

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:50.670
I forgot about Sutea's condition...

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.960
It wasn't like I forgot about you!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:56.710
Who am I kidding?

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:59.790
God, I'm the worst...

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:07.880
God, I'm the worst...

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:13.830
Koushi's going through a tough time right now,
and I'm making things even worse...

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:23.880
My body is more sensitive to heat
than most people's.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:30.040
Whether it's the warmth of an object
or the weather outside...

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:34.080
Even another person's body heat
is enough to make me feel miserable.

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:42.580
Then again, my condition is the whole reason why
Koushi and I became friends in the first place...

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:49.290
We're glad that we won, a flower costs one monme

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:54.540
Seiun Preschool

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:53.170
We're sad that we lost, a flower costs one monme

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:55.080
We want that kid right there

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:57.080
Which kid do you mean?

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.920
Let's talk it over

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:00.670
Yeah, good idea!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:01.790
One more time!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.880
'Kay, let's do it!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.040
Ready, go!

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.080
Hey, it's my turn next!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:09.130
Sure thing!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.750
C'mon, let's go!

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.670
Gross and sticky and sweaty...

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:17.170
Mashing their hands together...

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:23.210
It's way too hot for that. How dumb.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.380
Hey, you!

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.790
Come play Hana Ichi Monme with us.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:42.170
No, thanks. I hate touching people.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.290
How come?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:48.000
The heat makes my body twitch...

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.710
Uh-huh...

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:53.380
I get jittery when I hold hands for too long...

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.330
Dizzy, too.

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.130
Uh-huh...

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:01.460
Does it make you tired?

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.460
Very.

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.830
He left...

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.380
What are you doing, Koushi?!

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:23.130
You can't just dig in the freezer!

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.830
Teacher! I need ice! Ice!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.130
Wha-? Ice?!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.790
What do you need ice for?!

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:33.710
Perfect!

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.380
Here.

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:56.290
Does that feel any better?

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.170
Yeah...

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.210
Then let's go!

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.290
After that...

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:32.420
What happened after that...?

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.040
I think his hands went right back
to a normal temperature,

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:39.710
so I got annoyed and pushed him away...

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:50.130
The sensation of your hands touching my face...

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.380
I still remember it, even now...

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.250
What the heck is wrong with me?

00:17:56.540 --> 00:18:00.540
The way I react is always the opposite of how I feel...

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:08.540
And yet, ever since then,
you've never left my side...

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:12.500
You're always looking out for me...

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:20.580
It made me happy, so I...

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:25.630
wanted to do... something...

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.670
in return...

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.290
Dummy.

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:39.460
You don't handle the heat well.
What are you doing on the roof?

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:46.630
Why... are your hands so cold?

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:50.460
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have grabbed you earlier.

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:52.460
But I didn't completely forget.

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:55.210
I remembered to pack these this morning.

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.210
It's full of ice packs...

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:00.130
'Cause of these, my lunchbox is nice and chilly.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.750
Finding them was a pain in the butt.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:17.630
I asked Miss Mineru for help, and we
scraped together every last one in the dorm.

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.460
"Mineru"?

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:20.880
"Dorm"?

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.290
Let me start from the beginning...

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:27.130
Uh-huh.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:30.580
I see...

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:33.540
The dorm mother for a women's dorm?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.750
It's creative, I'll give you that.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:38.000
No, it's the truth! For real!

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:42.330
If you say so.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.670
Let's go.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:50.460
Huh?

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:52.080
I wanna see it for myself.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.790
Take me to this dorm.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.330
I-is that really necessary?!

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:59.210
Besides, you can't even walk straight.
You should rest!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.920
Shut up! I feel fi-

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.210
Koushi...

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.330
Sorry!

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.380
I wanted to be...

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:46.290
...someone who...

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.000
...you could rely on, too...

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.460
Or something stupid like that.

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.670
Whatever.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:11.710
I did it again...

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.250
Hey, um...

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.210
Are you really gonna follow me home?

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.630
Of course I am.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.460
It's just a dorm, y'know.

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:25.920
A women's dorm.

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:28.920
Yeah, but it's nothing special...

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:31.210
Is there a reason for you to have
a guilty conscience?

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:33.420
G-guil-?! No, of course not!

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:34.670
Then what's the problem?

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:38.460
She's right. I haven't done anything wrong.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:43.380
I'm simply doing my job as the dorm mother
by taking care of the residents.

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:48.710
I-it's my job... It's my...

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:55.130
On second thought, let's not!

00:21:55.130 --> 00:21:57.080
Jeez, Koushi. So you did do something-

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:59.580
No! I don't have even the
slightest reason to feel guilty!

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:00.920
EMERGENCY!

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:05.420
Oh my! Mineru, can't you be more careful?

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:07.170
My bad, my bad!

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:08.290
Huh?

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:10.250
Hiya, Koushi!

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:12.540
Welcome home!

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:15.000
As you can see, I had another accident...

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.790
Oh? And who is this?

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:19.380
What...?

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:26.630
It's gotta be you

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:28.380
It's gotta be you

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:29.960
It's gotta be you

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:32.130
I'm sure of it, but...

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:33.790
I can't admit it

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:35.580
I'll never admit it

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:37.170
And the truth is

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:39.330
I wanna tell you

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.420
You're still just like a child

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:46.040
Blind to everything around you

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:49.330
Those nonchalant actions of yours

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:52.790
Make my heart skip a beat

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:55.790
Why do I think

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:57.580
Of someone like her

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.420
As a rival?

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:01.080
It's bizzare

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:03.670
The longer that I live with you

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:09.500
The more that everyone seems to change

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:13.170
Hey! I love your bashful side

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:14.960
And your serious side, too

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:18.250
I always, always want you by my side

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:20.290
Aah! This position that I'm in

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:21.960
I don't wanna give it up

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:23.750
I wanna profess my love!

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:27.080
Our hectic daily life together

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:30.080
I wish it could go on forever

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:30.670
It's like

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:31.290
When you're here

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:32.040
When you're here

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:32.790
Next to me

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:34.630
I can't help but blush

00:23:34.630 --> 00:23:35.880
It's gotta be you

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:37.540
It's gotta be you

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:39.290
It's gotta be you

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:41.460
I'm sure of it, but...

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:43.080
I can't admit it

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:44.880
I'll never admit it

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:46.460
And the truth is

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.040
I wanna tell you, but...

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:53.210
Is that you, Koushi?!

00:23:53.630 --> 00:23:55.960
Miss Kiriya?! Please don't look at me!

00:23:55.960 --> 00:23:57.880
I had no idea you're into that type of thing...

00:23:57.880 --> 00:23:59.670
Wait, there's a perfectly reasonable explanation-!

00:23:59.670 --> 00:24:00.880
I have no problem with it.

00:24:00.880 --> 00:24:04.460
You are who you are,
and I support you one hundred percent!

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:07.330
Even if it means that you like dressing up as a girl!

00:24:07.330 --> 00:24:11.040
A Childhood Friend Visits the Dorm

00:24:07.330 --> 00:24:11.040
Koushi Goes Undercover at a Women's College

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:09.790
There's no need for support, trust me!
